Package: qualitychecks
Title: A Package Performing Quality Checks on Fearbase Datasets
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Samuel Rasmus", "Thiele", , "samuel.thiele@uni-bielefeld.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package performs standardized quality checks on datasets from the fearbase. It checks the following Parameters: 'participant_n', 'participant_id', 'phases', 'ratings', 'questionnaires', 'aggregation', transformation', 'timepoint', and 'frequency'.
